---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy · Bow Tie Kreative"
  description="How Bow Tie Kreative uses cookies on bowtiekreative.com."
  canonical="https://bowtiekreative.com/cookie-policy"
>
  <section class="rp-section rp-backlight">
    <div class="rp-container">
      <div class="rp-legal">
        <span class="rp-eyebrow">Policies</span>
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="rp-legal-date">Last updated: January 1, 2024</p>

        <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your web browser. They help websites function properly, remember preferences, and understand how visitors use the site.</p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use the following categories of cookies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Essential:</strong> Required for basic site functionality (session management, security). These cannot be disabled.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics (GA4) cookies that help us understand page visits, traffic sources, and user behaviour. Data is anonymized where possible.</li>
          <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Used to deliver relevant advertising and measure campaign effectiveness.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <p>Some cookies are placed by trusted third parties:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics (GA4):</strong> Website analytics. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>PayPal:</strong> Payment processing cookies when you interact with payment forms.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Your Choices</h2>
        <p>When you first visit our site, you will see a cookie consent banner. You can:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Accept all cookies.</li>
          <li>Reject non-essential cookies (essential cookies will still function).</li>
          <li>Change your preferences at any time via our cookie settings.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can also control cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about cookies?<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:hello@bowtiekreative.com">hello@bowtiekreative.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .rp-legal { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .rp-legal h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .rp-legal-date { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-small); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .rp-legal h2 { margin-top: var(--space-7); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); font-size: var(--text-h3); }
  .rp-legal p { color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .rp-legal ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: var(--space-5); }
  .rp-legal ul li { padding: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-2) var(--space-5); position: relative; color: var(--text-body); }
  .rp-legal ul li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--rp-accent); }
</style>